        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Our_Family_2.jpg",
        "heading": "",
        "body": "<p>Having grown up on Isolation Ridge, we share a deep, intuitive understanding of the vineyard and its wines - from vine to barrel, bottle to glass. That closeness gives us the confidence to question, refine and evolve, always in pursuit of expressing the site at its best.</p><p>We owe much to our parents, Judi Cullam and the late Barrie Smith, who first planted vines here in 1988. Their vision established the foundations of integrity, character and respect for place that continue to shape everything we do.</p>",
