        "image": "shopify://shop_images/A_Natural_Haven.jpg",
        "heading": "",
        "body": "<p>Living on the land brings both privilege and responsibility. It is where we raise our families, and it drives our commitment to care for the vineyard in a way that will leave it in better condition for the next generation. Daily immersion in the vineyard allows us to respond to the subtle needs of the vines, guiding them towards producing fruit of clarity and balance - the essential starting point for great wine.</p><p>Over time, it Is the accumulation of small, thoughtful decisions in both vineyard and winery that defines our wines and sets them apart.</p>",
