            "name": "Elizabeth Smith",
            "role": "",
            "bio": "<p>Elizabeth attended the University of Western Australia and graduated with a Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Agriculture Science in 1998, before furthering her studies in Viticulture at Charles Sturt University. Elizabeth gained further experience by working vintages in the wine regions of California, Spain and New Zealand.</p>",
